  "description": "Moving in together was supposed to be the ultimate romantic dream for Lee Hyeon and Hong Baek-Ya. But sharing an apartment exposes cracks in their dynamic. Confused by Hyeon's sudden hesitation in bed, Baek-Ya begins to overthink, just as Hyeon spots a new rival hovering around his partner on campus. With their feelings completely laid bare, domestic bliss quickly turns into a sizzling battle of pride and desire.\n\n(Source: Lezhin US)",
